---
import CtaBtn from '../website/cta-btn.astro';
---

  <!-- ============================================================
       PRICING
  ============================================================ -->
  <section class="sec sec-light">
    <div class="container">

      <div class="row mb-5">
        <div class="col-12 text-center">
          <span class="zin-eyebrow">Pricing</span>
          <h2 class="zin-h2">One price. One job. 14 days free.</h2>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="row justify-content-center">
        <div class="col-lg-6">
          <div class="price-card">
            <div class="price-amount text-center mb-2">
              £9.97
              <span class="small">per month</span>
            </div>

            <ul class="price-list">
              <li><span class="price-tick">✓</span> No tiers. No upsells.</li>
              <li><span class="price-tick">✓</span> 14-day free trial included</li>
              <li><span class="price-tick">✓</span> Cancel anytime — no questions asked</li>
              <li><span class="price-tick">✓</span> Full refund if cancelled in trial period</li>
            </ul>
            <div class="text-center">
              <CtaBtn />
            </div>
            
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="row justify-content-center mt-5">
        <div class="col-lg-8 text-center">
          <p class="zin-body-sm mb-3">If you are creating social media content, you're creating content worth far more than £9.97. Zin will provide inspiration, a starting point, an outline, all from real material you've already captured.</p>
          <p class="zin-body-sm mb-3">With Zin, you never need to sit down to write without something genuine to work with.</p>
          <p class="zin-body-sm">Free trial period: No payment is taken for 14 days. Click below to read Cancellation and Subscription policy.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="row justify-content-center mt-4">
        <div class="col-lg-8 text-center">

          <details class="zin-details mb-4">
            <summary class="zin-details-summary">Cancellation and Subscription policy</summary>
            <div class="zin-details-body">
              <p class="zin-body mb-2">There is no long-term commitment with Zin.</p>
              <p class="zin-body mb-2">No payment is taken for 14 days. After 14 days, the monthly subscription starts.  The monthly subscription is £9.97. </p>
              <p class="zin-body mb-2">You can cancel your Zin subscription at any time.  To cancel, send an email to <a href="mailto:support@zincontent.com" class="zin-link-orange">support@zincontent.com</a>. We will cancel your subscription immediately, no questions asked. Refunds are managed by Stripe and are usually issued within 2–3 days.</>
            </div>
          </details>

          <p class="zin-body-sm mb-4">
            <i class="bi bi-star-fill text-warning me-2" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            If you would like to generate authentic, stand-out content, click the button below.
            <i class="bi bi-star-fill text-warning ms-2" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </p>

          <CtaBtn subtext="In an age of AI, authenticity is a strategic advantage. Be authentic with Zin." />

        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>